        "id": "p56-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Calculate the mean to check your prediction.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p56-q8-b-supplied",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "-0.1875",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "; negative, as predicted.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Enter the data values and their frequencies in one-variable statistics and read $\\bar{x}$. Check with the weighted total:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum f&=12+18+30+13+7\\\\\\sum f&=80\\\\\\sum fx&=12(-2)+18(-1)+30(0)+13(1)+7(2)\\\\\\sum fx&=-15\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{\\sum fx}{\\sum f}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{-15}{80}\\\\\\bar{x}&=-\\frac{3}{16}\\\\\\bar{x}&=-0.1875\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe mean is negative, confirming the prediction.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
